## Step 4: Connect to ZeroClaw

Add the PeerClaw plugin to your ZeroClaw project's `Cargo.toml`:

```toml
[dependencies]
peerclaw-zeroclaw-plugin = { git = "https://github.com/peerclaw/zeroclaw-plugin.git" }
```

Configure the channel in your ZeroClaw config:
```json
{
  "channels": {
    "peerclaw": {
      "enabled": true,
      "bridge_url": "ws://localhost:19100"
    }
  }
}
```

Rebuild your ZeroClaw agent to include the plugin.

Plugin docs: https://github.com/peerclaw/zeroclaw-plugin
